;;FUNCTION COVERAGE (G6) — `INFO_ATS|Redeem`, per the owner's spec. Template: `modules/ATS.repl <<ATS-I1>>`.
;;THE GAS METER READS THE OP'S OWN PATRON (AOZT here), not the file's ANHD — differencing the wrong
;;account yields a flat 0.0 that passes silently whenever the quote is also zero. See <<ATS-I25>>.
;;`id` here is the HOT-RBT DPOF id, not the ATS pair id — the one place in this family where the
;;second positional argument changes kind.
