;;FUNCTION COVERAGE (G6) — `INFO_ATS|AddHotRBT`, per the owner's spec. Template: <<ATS-I1>>.
;;THE GAS METER READS AOZT, the op's own patron — see <<ATS-I25>>.
;;
;;FOUR PRECONDITIONS AT ONCE, and no standing pair satisfies them (`08_DPOF`-side `ATS|C>ADD-HOT-RBT`,
;;`08_ATS.pact:870`): the caller must own BOTH the DPOF and the pair; the DPOF must not be a V|/Z|/H|
;;special; the DPOF must have ZERO supply; and the PAIR must not already carry a hot-RBT. That last
;;one disqualifies every pair on this chain — PlebeicStrength has DDKOSON, TestKickPair has THRBT —
;;and `THRBT` itself is permanently unusable because ATS-G23 latched its `can-upgrade` off for good.
;;So BOTH sides are issued virgin: a fresh pair and a fresh zero-supply DPOF. That is the same
;;issue-a-virgin-entity pattern that unlocked <<ATS-I31>>, <<ATS-I32>> and three AQP blocks; the
;;"no fixture" label these ops carried was a statement about the standing state, not about the op.
;;
;;The three setup issues all charge STOA and are measured elsewhere (<<ATS-I32>>, and the DPTF/DPOF
;;issue previews in `modules/DPTF.repl` / `modules/DPOF.repl`); they close before the window opens.
